    "description": "<p>You focus light to pierce illusions and darkness.</p><p>For <strong>1 minute</strong>, you cannot be <strong>Blinded</strong>, and your eyes cast bright beams of light out to <strong>30 spaces </strong>away.</p><p>Darkness and illusions are suppressed by the light, so they disappear while you look at them, but rematerialize once you look away.</p><p>Objects lit by your gaze appear as if bathed by the light of day.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 minutes</strong>.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.XrDcA89TI6GA6OIq]{Effulgent Gaze}</p>",
